-- Prova D-168 (grammatica 1.10): le parole di BASE della SPECIFICA_02 0.4 sono riservate.
-- Ogni CAPABILITY con una parola riservata per nome non è riconosciuta; in minuscolo è un nome.

CSC ParoleBase VERSION 0.1
  PURPOSE "Le parole di BASE non si usano come nomi"
  CAPABILITY AFTER
  CAPABILITY BEFORE
  CAPABILITY BETWEEN
  CAPABILITY UNTIL
  CAPABILITY PRECEDES
  CAPABILITY FOR
  CAPABILITY LEAST
  CAPABILITY ACCEPTS
  CAPABILITY ONLY
  CAPABILITY REQUIRES
  CAPABILITY ENSURES
  CAPABILITY RESOLVES
  CAPABILITY CHANGED
  CAPABILITY TRANSITION
  CAPABILITY ON
  CAPABILITY WHEN
  CAPABILITY FOLLOWS
  CAPABILITY ALL
  CAPABILITY ABS
  CAPABILITY MIN
  CAPABILITY MAX
  CAPABILITY LOG10
  CAPABILITY ROUND
  CAPABILITY FLOOR
  CAPABILITY CEIL
  CAPABILITY ensures
  GUARANTEE g1: VERBAL "ensures in minuscolo è un nome" VERIFY BY INSPECTION "il rapporto"
END
